  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 307.04 Issuance of Registration Number. A business registration certificate showing the registration number shall be issued to applicants upon completion of the requirements under Pes 307.02.\n\nSource. #2002, eff 4-l9-82; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
